    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d776">

                <pb facs="0722" n="710" xml:id="pg710"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">890F.24/188: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister Resident in Saudi Arabia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Moose</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extracts]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jidda</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-06-22T22:00:00+03:06">June 22, 1944—10
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 10:09 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>175. Acting Foreign Minister today amplified statements reported in Cairo’s 1670,
                    June 18, 10 a.m. stating that deaths by starvation are occurring in southern
                    Hejaz and that besides stopping free distribution of food Saudi Government has
                    suspended sales because of depleted stocks. He produced figures to show that
                    present Government stocks of foodstuffs now total 2,105 tons only, of which
                    1,363 are for general distribution.</p>
                <p>American representative in MESC<anchor n="14" xml:id="d776-f1"/> has been asked
                    to supply Legation with statistics of food imported in 1943 and current year to
                    aid in evaluating figures of Acting Minister.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <p>Statistics by airmail tomorrow.<anchor n="15" xml:id="d776-f2"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moose</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
